WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Murakaza neza kuri IBONA — urubuga rw'ibikorwa mu Kinyarwanda.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.500
Reba videos, umuziki, na filimi byawe ku rubuga rwawe rwite.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Kigali Nights — ijoro ryiza mu murwa mukuru w'u Rwanda.

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.500
Ikipe yacu yagutoreye umuziki w'umwimerere mwiza cyane.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Murakoze cyane kubera ko mwifatanyije natwe muri uru rugendo.
